over:shadow-[0_26px_72px_-12px_rgba(201,161,93,0.78)]">לכל ההרצאות והסדנאות<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 rtl:rotate-180 rtl:group-hover:-translate-x-1">→</span></a></div></div></div><div class="cine-hero-line mt-10 w-full [animation-delay:1300ms] lg:ms-auto lg:w-[52%]"><div class="flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-2 px-3 text-center md:px-6 "><span class="font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-none tracking-tight text-accent xl:text-5xl">2</span><span class="text-xs leading-snug text-text-secondary md:text-sm">ימים של השראה</span></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-2 px-3 text-center md:px-6 border-s border-white/12"><span class="font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-none tracking-tight text-accent xl:text-5xl">80+</span><span class="text-xs leading-snug text-text-secondary md:text-sm">קולות על הבמה</span></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-2 px-3 text-center md:px-6 border-s border-white/12"><span class="font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-none tracking-tight text-accent xl:text-5xl">2,000+</span><span class="text-xs leading-snug text-text-secondary md:text-sm">שותפים לדרך</span></div></div></div></div></section><div class="cine-atmos [--atmos:rgb(122_142_170_/_0.05)]"><section id="story" class="relative overflow-hidden pt-10 pb-8 md:pt-14 md:pb-12 lg:pt-16"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-3/5 bg-[radial-gradient(50%_50%_at_35%_50%,color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-accent)_10%,transparent),transparent_72%)]"></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 md:px-12"><div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[55fr_45fr] lg:gap-20"><div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-accent">על הכנס</p><h2 class="mt-6 block max-w-xl font-display text-4xl font-bold leadi