ont-medium uppercase tracking-[0.34em] text-accent">The Public Service Innovation Summit</p><h1 class="cine-hero-line mt-6 font-display text-6xl font-extrabold leading-[0.9] tracking-tight lg:text-7xl xl:text-8xl"><span class="text-text-primary">There is a moment everything changes</span><span class="text-accent"> <!-- -->2026</span></h1><p class="cine-hero-line mt-7 max-w-lg text-xl leading-relaxed text-text-secondary [animation-delay:500ms] xl:text-2xl">This October, in Jerusalem, it happens again.</p><div class="cine-hero-line mt-8 [animation-delay:700ms]"></div><ul class="cine-hero-line mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-10 gap-y-4 [animation-delay:850ms]"><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="grid size-11 flex-none place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent/12 text-accent"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5"><rect x="4" y="5.5" width="16" height="14.5" rx="2.5"></rect><path d="M4 10h16M8.5 3.5v3.5M15.5 3.5v3.5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-base text-text-secondary md:text-lg">20–21 October 2026</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="grid size-11 flex-none place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent/12 text-accent"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5"><path d="M12 21s-6.5-5.4-6.5-10.2A6.3 6.3 0 0 1 12 4.5a6.3 6.3 0 0 1 6.5 6.3C18.5 15.6 12 21 12 21Z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10.8" r="2.1"></circle></svg></span><span class="text-base text-text-secondary md:text-lg">The ICC, Jerusalem</span></li></ul><div class="cine-hero-line mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 [animation-delay:1000ms]"><a href="/en/program" class="group inline-flex min-h-14 items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-brand px-10 text-base font-medium text-brand-contrast shadow-[0_20px_60px_-14px_rgba(201,161,93,0.6)] transition-all duration-500 hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_26px_72px_-12px_rgba(201,161,93,0.78)]">All sessions &amp; workshops<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 rtl:rotate-180 rtl:group-hover:-translate-x-1">→</span></a></div></div></div><div class="cine-hero-line mt-10 w-full [animation-delay:1300ms] lg:ms-auto lg:w-[52%]"><div class="flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-2 px-3 text-center md:px-6 "><span class="font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-none tracking-tight text-accent xl:text-5xl">2</span><span class="text-xs leading-snug text-text-secondary md:text-sm">days of inspiration</span></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-2 px-3 text-center md:px-6 border-s border-white/12"><span class="font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-none tracking-tight text-accent xl:text-5xl">80+</span><span class="text-xs leading-snug text-text-secondary md:text-sm">voices on stage</span></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-2 px-3 text-center md:px-6 border-s border-white/12"><span class="font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-none tracking-tight text-accent xl:text-5xl">2,000+</span><span class="text-xs leading-snug text-text-secondary md:text-sm">partners on the road</span></div></div></div></div></section><div class="cine-atmos [--atmos:rgb(122_142_170_/_0.05)]"><section id="story" class="relative overflow-hidden pt-10 pb-8 md:pt-14 md:pb-12 lg:pt-16"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-3/5 bg-[radial-gradient(50%_50%_at_35%_50%,color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-accent)_10%,transparent),transparent_72%)]"></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 md:px-12"><div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[55fr_45fr] lg:gap-20"><div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-accent">About</p><h2 class="mt-6 block max-w-xl font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.12] tracking-tight md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl lg:leading-[1.08]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline"><span class="inline-block whitespace-pre" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(0.65em)">Where<!-- --> </span><span class="inline-block whitespace-pre" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(0.65em)">vision<!-- --> </span><span class="inline-block whitespace-pre" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(0.65em)">meets<!-- --> </span><span class="inline-block whitespace-pre" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(0.65em)">execution</span></span><span class="sr-only">Where vision meets execution</span></h2><p class="mt-7 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary md:text-xl">Real change does not happen in documents. It happens when people who believe the same thing share the same room, at the same moment. For two days a year, the people shaping Israel’s public service stop everything — to imagine it anew.</p></div><ul class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 md:mt-14 sm:grid-cols-4 sm:gap-x-0"><li class="flex flex-col items-start gap-3.5 " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-7 text-accent"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"></circle><path d="M3.5 20a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0"></path><path d="M16 5.2a3 3 0 0 1 0 5.6M17.5 20a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-3-4.9"></path></svg><p class="font-display text-base font-semibold leading-snug text-text-primary md:text-lg">Quality networking</p><p class="text-xs leading-snug text-text-secondary md:text-sm">Thousands of peers</p></li><li class="flex flex-col items-start gap-3.5 sm:border-s sm:border-white/10 sm:ps-6" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-7 